---
description: Collaborative review, disagreement, and disposition controls
globs: ["src/neuroai_workbench/review.py", "docs/reference/review.md", "tests/unit/test_review.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Reviewer identifiers and roles are local attributed claims, not authenticated identities or institutional authority.
- Keep assignments, statements, disagreements, and dispositions immutable and hash-linked.
- Never apply a review statement or disposition directly to an assessment.
- Require explicit typed scope and reject unresolved targets or evidence references.
- Only a recorded lead assessor or decision authority with covering scope may dispose a statement.
- Preserve minority views and rejected proposals in the record.
- Add tampering, authorization, duplicate-disposition, and non-mutation tests for every workflow change.
